{#
settings/_compose_defaults.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
The Compose defaults card: per account, what it does with read receipts and
which addresses it always Bccs (#692) — and the addresses that differ.

WHY IT LOOKS LIKE THIS
──────────────────────
It used to draw one row per alias per account, each with its own control, and
nearly all of them said "Account default". Three accounts with a handful of
aliases was a screen of identical dropdowns (#692). So:

  • One folded row per account, with a one-line summary of what it does. The
    account being edited is open; with none being edited, the first is.
  • Inside, the account's own settings, and then ONLY the addresses that
    differ — "Addresses that differ". An address appears there once it has an
    override of either setting (compose_default_exceptions()), and "Add an
    exception for…" reveals the editor for one that does not yet. It becomes
    a stored exception when one of its controls is changed, and stops being
    one when both are put back ("Remove exception").
  • Always Bcc is a chip field with the composer's contact suggestions
    (settings--address-chips) that saves on every chip. Its responses replace
    only the summary lines, never the field — see
    ComposeDefaultsController::bccResponse().

Every control is a plain form post with its own CSRF token, as before; the
selects and chips submit themselves.

Variables:
  manageableAccounts  list<Account>
  openAccountId       ?int  the account a change was just made to
  openAliasId         ?int  the exception a change was just made to
#}
{% import 'settings/_compose_defaults_macros.html.twig' as summaries %}

{% if manageableAccounts is empty %}
    <p class="px-4 py-8 text-center text-sm text-ink-faint italic">
        {{ 'settings.accounts.empty'|trans }}
    </p>
{% else %}
    {% set modes = ['never', 'ask', 'always'] %}
    {% set openAccountId = openAccountId ?? null %}
    {% set openAliasId = openAliasId ?? null %}
    {% set chipI18n = {
        create:    'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.chips.create'|trans,
        noResults: 'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.chips.no_results'|trans,
        add:       'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.placeholder'|trans,
    }|json_encode %}

    <div class="divide-y divide-line">
        {% for account in manageableAccounts %}
            {% set accountMode = account.getSetting('compose.read_receipt.default')|default('never') %}
            {% set accountBcc = account.getSetting('compose.bcc')|default([]) %}
            {% set exceptions = compose_default_exceptions(account) %}
            {% set exceptionIds = exceptions|map(a => a.id) %}
            {% set isOpen = openAccountId is not null ? openAccountId == account.id : loop.first %}

            <details class="group/account relative" data-compose-defaults-account="{{ account.id }}" {{ isOpen ? 'open' : '' }}>
                <summary class="flex items-center gap-3 px-4 py-3 cursor-pointer list-none hover:bg-hover transition-colors">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-right w-3 text-[11px] text-ink-faint transition-transform group-open/account:rotate-90" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                    <span class="shrink-0 text-sm font-medium text-ink">{{ account.displayAddress }}</span>
                    <span id="compose-defaults-summary-{{ account.id }}"
                          class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate text-right text-xs text-ink-faint">{{ summaries.account_summary(account) }}</span>
                </summary>

                <div class="pl-10 pr-4 pb-4"
                     data-controller="settings--compose-exceptions">

                    {# ── Read receipts, the account-wide answer ─────────────── #}
                    <form method="post"
                          action="{{ path('app_compose_defaults_read_receipt_default', { id: account.id }) }}"
                          data-turbo-stream
                          class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 py-2" data-controller="ui--auto-submit">
                        <input type="hidden" name="_token"
                               value="{{ csrf_token('compose-defaults-receipt' ~ account.id) }}">

                        <label class="min-w-0 flex-1" for="receipt-default-{{ account.id }}">
                            <span class="block text-sm text-ink">{{ 'settings.compose_defaults.read_receipt.label'|trans }}</span>
                            <span class="block text-xs text-ink-faint">{{ 'settings.compose_defaults.read_receipt.hint'|trans }}</span>
                        </label>

                        <select id="receipt-default-{{ account.id }}"
                                name="mode"
                                data-action="change->ui--auto-submit#submit"
                                class="shrink-0 h-9 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface text-sm px-2 text-ink">
                            {% for mode in modes %}
                                <option value="{{ mode }}" {{ accountMode == mode ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                                    {{ ('settings.compose_defaults.read_receipt.mode.' ~ mode)|trans }}
                                </option>
                            {% endfor %}
                        </select>
                    </form>

                    {# ── Always Bcc, the account-wide list ──────────────────── #}
                    <div class="py-2">
                        <label for="bcc-default-{{ account.id }}-ts-control">
                            <span class="block text-sm text-ink">{{ 'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.label'|trans }}</span>
                            <span class="block text-xs text-ink-faint">{{ 'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.hint'|trans }}</span>
                        </label>

                        {% include 'settings/_compose_defaults_chips.html.twig' with {
                            id:          'bcc-default-' ~ account.id,
                            action:      path('app_compose_defaults_bcc_default', { id: account.id }),
                            token:       csrf_token('compose-defaults-bcc' ~ account.id),
                            addresses:   accountBcc,
                            placeholder: 'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.placeholder'|trans,
                            label:       'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.label'|trans,
                            i18n:        chipI18n,
                        } only %}
                    </div>

                    {# ── Addresses that differ ──────────────────────────────── #}
                    {% if account.aliases|length %}
                        <div class="mt-2">
                            <p class="text-xs text-ink-faint mb-1">{{ 'settings.compose_defaults.exceptions.heading'|trans }}</p>

                            <ul class="divide-y divide-line/60" data-settings--compose-exceptions-target="list">
                                {% for alias in account.aliases %}
                                    {% set isException = alias.id in exceptionIds %}
                                    {% set aliasMode = account.getSetting('compose.read_receipt.alias.' ~ alias.id) %}
                                    {% set aliasBcc = account.getSetting('compose.bcc.alias.' ~ alias.id) %}

                                    {# Every address has its editor in the markup; one that
                                       is not an exception is hidden until "Add an exception
                                       for…" reveals it, so revealing is a DOM change and
                                       not a round trip. #}
                                    <li data-compose-defaults-exception="{{ alias.id }}"
                                        {{ isException ? '' : 'hidden data-settings--compose-exceptions-target=candidate' }}>
                                        <details class="group/exception" {{ openAliasId == alias.id ? 'open' : '' }}>
                                            <summary class="flex items-center gap-3 py-2 cursor-pointer list-none">
                                                <span class="min-w-0 flex-1">
                                                    <span class="block truncate text-sm text-ink">{{ alias.address }}</span>
                                                    <span id="compose-defaults-alias-summary-{{ alias.id }}"
                                                          class="block truncate text-xs text-ink-faint">{{ summaries.alias_summary(account, alias) }}</span>
                                                </span>
                                                <span class="shrink-0 rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-ink-muted group-open/exception:bg-raised">
                                                    {{ 'settings.compose_defaults.exceptions.edit'|trans }}
                                                </span>
                                            </summary>

                                            <div class="pb-3 space-y-3">
                                                {# Read receipts for this address #}
                                                <form method="post"
                                                      action="{{ path('app_compose_defaults_read_receipt_alias', { id: account.id, aliasId: alias.id }) }}"
                                                      data-turbo-stream
                                                      class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3" data-controller="ui--auto-submit">
                                                    <input type="hidden" name="_token"
                                                           value="{{ csrf_token('compose-defaults-receipt-alias' ~ alias.id) }}">
                                                    <label class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-ink-muted" for="receipt-alias-{{ alias.id }}">
                                                        {{ 'settings.compose_defaults.read_receipt.label'|trans }}
                                                        <span class="sr-only">{{ 'settings.compose_defaults.read_receipt.for_alias'|trans({'%alias%': alias.address}) }}</span>
                                                    </label>
                                                    <select id="receipt-alias-{{ alias.id }}"
                                                            name="mode"
                                                            data-action="change->ui--auto-submit#submit"
                                                            class="shrink-0 h-9 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface text-sm px-2 text-ink">
                                                        {# The empty option is "follow the account", and
                                                           the controller REMOVES the key for it. #}
                                                        <option value="" {{ aliasMode is null ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                                                            {{ 'settings.compose_defaults.read_receipt.inherit'|trans({
                                                                '%mode%': ('settings.compose_defaults.read_receipt.mode.' ~ accountMode)|trans,
                                                            }) }}
                                                        </option>
                                                        {% for mode in modes %}
                                                            <option value="{{ mode }}" {{ aliasMode == mode ? 'selected' : '' }}>
                                                                {{ ('settings.compose_defaults.read_receipt.mode.' ~ mode)|trans }}
                                                            </option>
                                                        {% endfor %}
                                                    </select>
                                                </form>

                                                {# Always Bcc for this address: the account's list, or its own #}
                                                <div>
                                                    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                                                        <span class="min-w-0 flex-1 text-sm text-ink-muted">{{ 'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.label'|trans }}</span>
                                                        <form method="post"
                                                              action="{{ path('app_compose_defaults_bcc_alias', { id: account.id, aliasId: alias.id }) }}"
                                                              data-turbo-stream
                                                              class="shrink-0 grid grid-flow-col auto-cols-fr rounded-lg border border-line overflow-hidden"
                                                              role="group" aria-label="{{ 'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.for_alias'|trans({'%alias%': alias.address}) }}">
                                                            <input type="hidden" name="_token"
                                                                   value="{{ csrf_token('compose-defaults-bcc-alias' ~ alias.id) }}">
                                                            {% for choice in ['inherit', 'override'] %}
                                                                {% set pressed = (choice == 'inherit') == (aliasBcc is null) %}
                                                                <button type="submit" name="{{ choice }}" value="1"
                                                                        aria-pressed="{{ pressed ? 'true' : 'false' }}"
                                                                        class="px-3 py-1.5 text-xs transition-colors cursor-pointer
                                                                               {{ pressed ? 'bg-accent text-accent-ink' : 'text-ink-muted hover:bg-hover' }}">
                                                                    {{ ('settings.compose_defaults.bcc.per_address.' ~ choice)|trans }}
                                                                </button>
                                                            {% endfor %}
                                                        </form>
                                                    </div>

                                                    {% if aliasBcc is null %}
                                                        <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-faint" data-bcc-account-caption="{{ account.id }}">
                                                            {{ accountBcc is empty
                                                                ? 'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.per_address.account_none'|trans
                                                                : 'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.per_address.account_list'|trans({ '%addresses%': accountBcc|join(', ') }) }}
                                                        </p>
                                                    {% else %}
                                                        {% include 'settings/_compose_defaults_chips.html.twig' with {
                                                            id:          'bcc-alias-' ~ alias.id,
                                                            action:      path('app_compose_defaults_bcc_alias', { id: account.id, aliasId: alias.id }),
                                                            token:       csrf_token('compose-defaults-bcc-alias' ~ alias.id),
                                                            addresses:   aliasBcc,
                                                            placeholder: 'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.placeholder'|trans,
                                                            empty:       'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.per_address.nobody'|trans,
                                                            label:       'settings.compose_defaults.bcc.for_alias'|trans({'%alias%': alias.address}),
                                                            i18n:        chipI18n,
                                                        } only %}
                                                    {% endif %}
                                                </div>

                                                <form method="post"
                                                      action="{{ path('app_compose_defaults_exception_remove', { id: account.id, aliasId: alias.id }) }}"
                                                      data-turbo-stream>
                                                    <input type="hidden" name="_token"
                                                           value="{{ csrf_token('compose-defaults-exception' ~ alias.id) }}">
                                                    <button type="submit" class="text-xs text-ink-faint hover:text-ink-muted transition-colors cursor-pointer">
                                                        {{ 'settings.compose_defaults.exceptions.remove'|trans }}
                                                        <span class="sr-only">{{ 'settings.compose_defaults.exceptions.remove_for'|trans({'%alias%': alias.address}) }}</span>
                                                    </button>
                                                </form>
                                            </div>
                                        </details>
                                    </li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>

                            {% if exceptions|length < account.aliases|length %}
                                <div class="pt-2" data-settings--compose-exceptions-target="picker">
                                    <label class="sr-only" for="exception-add-{{ account.id }}">{{ 'settings.compose_defaults.exceptions.add'|trans }}</label>
                                    <select id="exception-add-{{ account.id }}"
                                            data-action="change->settings--compose-exceptions#add"
                                            class="h-8 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface text-xs px-2 text-ink-muted">
                                        <option value="">{{ 'settings.compose_defaults.exceptions.add'|trans }}</option>
                                        {% for alias in account.aliases %}
                                            {% if alias.id not in exceptionIds %}
                                                <option value="{{ alias.id }}">{{ alias.address }}</option>
                                            {% endif %}
                                        {% endfor %}
                                    </select>
                                </div>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                    {% endif %}
                </div>
            </details>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
{% endif %}
